				1573,
				42
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement hierarchy prepare, editor text IPC, and selection forwarding\n\nAdd call hierarchy and type hierarchy prepare entry-points across the full gRPC+LSP provider pipeline. The new `PerformCallHierarchy` and `PerformTypeHierarchy` provider modules in `Source/RPC/CocoonService/Provider/` parse the URI+position request and delegate to `PrepareCallHierarchy`/`PrepareTypeHierarchy` on the `LanguageFeatureProviderRegistry`, which invokes `$prepareCallHierarchyItems`/`$prepareTypeHierarchyItems` on the registered extension provider via Cocoon. This unblocks the incoming/outgoing calls and subtypes/supertypes panels in the editor UI.\n\nBridge two new Cocoon→Mountain→Sky notification atoms for extension-driven editor mutations: `window.setTextEditorDecorations` uses a channel-drain batching mechanism (16 ms frame-aligned aggregation, unbounded sender) to coalesce ~5-200+ calls/second into a single `sky://decoration/set-ranges` Tauri event per frame; `window.applyTextEdits` forwards `{uri, edits}` directly as `sky://editor/apply-text-edits` for `editor.edit(cb)` callers (formatters, code actions, vim-mode, Error Lens).\n\nAdd the `window.revealRange` Track Effect to `Source/Track/Effect/CreateEffectForRequest/Workspace.rs`, routing extension calls through `SendUserInterfaceRequest` to `sky://editor/revealRange` for go-to-definition and error-navigation scrolling.\n\nFire `document.willSave` to Cocoon before writing to disk in the workspace-save Track Effect, giving `onWillSaveTextDocument` listeners (format-on-save, organize-imports, trailing-whitespace strippers) a 1.5-second grace window before the actual disk write.\n\nWire two new Sky→Mountain IPC handlers in the `mountain_ipc_invoke` dispatcher — `sky:editor:selectionChanged` and `sky:editor:activeChanged` — which store the active document URI in workspace state and forward the notification to Cocoon so `activeTextEditor.selection` and `onDidChangeTextEditorSelection`/`onDidChangeActiveTextEditor` stay live.\n\nRecord `TierIPC: Mountain` in Info.plist alongside existing tier metadata.\n\nIncludes pervasive `cargo fmt` reformatting across 30+ source files: single-line short signatures, collapsed nested expressions, reordered import blocks for PascalCase alphabetic consistency.",
			"SHA": "e85d15aa92cb2b7f45eb50f92c2c3613b10e4b56"
		},
